{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-data-access","title":"缓存抽象、连接池与数据访问性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/spring-boot-production/web-data/caching-data-access","wordCount":2782,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"缓存抽象-连接池与数据访问性能\">缓存抽象、连接池与数据访问性能</h1><p>数据访问性能的讨论很容易变成两派：一派说「加缓存」，另一派说「加连接」。两派的建议都可能是对的，但判断依据不是经验而是两个可测量的数：缓存命中率与连接池等待时间。这一章把这两件事放在同一张图上看——它们的关系是「缓存决定有多少请求能到达数据库，连接池决定到达数据库的请求能有多少并发执行」，前者是乘数，后者是上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-缓存是乘数-连接池是上限\">核心概念：缓存是乘数，连接池是上限</h2><p>数据访问性能由两个量决定：到达数据库的请求数（由缓存命中率决定），以及能同时执行的数据库操作数（由连接池容量决定）。前者是乘数，后者是上限，两者的相对关系决定了该优化哪一个。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{db} = Q_{app} \\times (1 - H_{cache})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{app}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是应用层请求速率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{cache}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是缓存命中率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{db}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是实际打到数据库的速率。这个式子的实用含义是：命中率从 0 提到 90%，等效于把数据库容量扩大十倍；而从 90% 提到 95%，只等效于再扩 2 倍，但代价（缓存容量、失效复杂度、一致性风险）可能大幅上升。因此<strong>缓存优化的边际收益是递减的</strong>，应该在某个命中率之后转向连接池与查询优化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观察到的现象</th>\n<th>归属维度</th>\n<th>首先检查</th>\n<th>无效的应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>请求慢，连接池 <code>pending</code> &gt; 0</td>\n<td>连接容量</td>\n<td>池大小 vs 数据库上限</td>\n<td>加缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求慢，连接池 <code>active</code> 低</td>\n<td>单查询效率</td>\n<td>执行计划、锁等待</td>\n<td>加连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高峰连接紧张，低谷空闲</td>\n<td>缓存命中率</td>\n<td>命中率与 TTL 设置</td>\n<td>永久扩大池</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据不一致</td>\n<td>失效策略</td>\n<td>写后删/更新是否到位</td>\n<td>缩短 TTL 掩盖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求变慢] --&gt; B{hikaricp.connections.pending}&#10;    B --&gt;|持续大于 0| C[池容量不足&lt;br/&gt;先核对 DB max_connections]&#10;    B --&gt;|= 0| D{hikaricp.connections.active}&#10;    D --&gt;|贴近上限| E[饱和: 查单查询耗时与锁]&#10;    D --&gt;|远低于上限| F[瓶颈不在数据层&lt;br/&gt;查缓存命中率与下游]&#10;    F --&gt; G{命中率是否可提升}&#10;    G --&gt;|可提升| H[调整 key/TTL/失效策略]&#10;    G --&gt;|已接近上限| I[转向查询优化或读副本]\">graph TD\n    A[请求变慢] --&gt; B{hikaricp.connections.pending}\n    B --&gt;|持续大于 0| C[池容量不足&lt;br/&gt;先核对 DB max_connections]\n    B --&gt;|= 0| D{hikaricp.connections.active}\n    D --&gt;|贴近上限| E[饱和: 查单查询耗时与锁]\n    D --&gt;|远低于上限| F[瓶颈不在数据层&lt;br/&gt;查缓存命中率与下游]\n    F --&gt; G{命中率是否可提升}\n    G --&gt;|可提升| H[调整 key/TTL/失效策略]\n    G --&gt;|已接近上限| I[转向查询优化或读副本]</pre><h2 id=\"spring-cache-抽象的位置\">Spring Cache 抽象的位置</h2><p><code>@Cacheable</code> 的实现是一个 AOP 通知（<code>CacheInterceptor</code>），它挂在代理的方法调用上，位置在事务拦截器之外（默认顺序下缓存先于事务）。这意味着三件事。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，缓存命中时方法体根本不执行</strong>，因此事务不会开启、连接不会被占用。这是缓存对连接池压力的真正贡献——不是「查询更快」，而是「查询不发生」。反过来说，如果缓存的 key 设计导致命中率低，这个收益就是零，而你还额外付了序列化和网络往返的成本。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，自调用同样让缓存失效</strong>，原因与 <a href=\"transactions-jpa-pitfalls\">声明式事务、JPA N+1 与批量陷阱</a> 中讨论的完全一致：代理被绕过。缓存与事务共享同一套 AOP 机制，共享同一组失效模式。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，<code>@Cacheable</code> 与 <code>@Transactional</code> 同时标注时，默认顺序影响语义。</strong> 缓存命中直接返回，事务不开启——这是期望行为。但如果缓存未命中且方法抛异常，写缓存的操作（<code>@Cacheable</code> 的 <code>unless</code> 条件）需要显式排除异常情况，否则可能缓存了异常状态或空结果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注解</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@Cacheable</code></td>\n<td>方法调用前查缓存</td>\n<td><code>key</code>、<code>condition</code>、<code>unless</code></td>\n<td>用 <code>condition</code> 做「是否走缓存」而用 <code>unless</code> 做「是否写缓存」时混淆两者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@CachePut</code></td>\n<td>方法调用后写缓存</td>\n<td><code>key</code></td>\n<td>期望它跳过方法执行（它不跳过）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@CacheEvict</code></td>\n<td>默认方法调用后清除</td>\n<td><code>beforeInvocation</code>、<code>allEntries</code></td>\n<td>多 key 依赖时只清一个 key，留下脏数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Caching</code></td>\n<td>组合多个操作</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>组合复杂度上升后难以推理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>@Cacheable</code> 的 key 生成默认用 <code>SimpleKeyGenerator</code>，无参数时是 <code>SimpleKey.EMPTY</code>，单参数时直接用参数，多参数时组合。这个默认在多参数方法上<strong>容易产生碰撞</strong>——尤其当参数是自定义对象而没有实现有意义的 <code>equals/hashCode</code> 时。显式 key 表达式比依赖默认更安全：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Cacheable(cacheNames = &quot;product&quot;, key = &quot;#tenantId + &#39;:&#39; + #productId&quot;)&#10;public ProductView get(String tenantId, Long productId) {&#10;    return productRepository.findView(tenantId, productId);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Cacheable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cacheNames</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"#tenantId + ':' + #productId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProductView </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String tenantId, Long productId) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> productRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tenantId, productId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多租户场景下 key 里必须带租户维度，否则跨租户读到同一份缓存是数据泄漏，不只是正确性问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存的失效策略与一致性代价\">缓存的失效策略与一致性代价</h2><p>缓存的一致性成本取决于「失效方式」而非「缓存介质」。三种主流策略的代价差异很大。</p>\n<p><strong>TTL 过期（time-to-live）。</strong> 实现最简单，代价是「最长 staleness = TTL」。适合容忍短时不一致的读多写少数据（商品详情、配置字典）。TTL 的选择依据是业务能接受的 staleness 上限，而不是「越小越安全」——TTL 变小会降低命中率，把压力还给数据库。</p>\n<p><strong>写时失效（write-invalidate）。</strong> 更新数据库后删除缓存 key，下次读时重建。它有经典的竞态：写线程删缓存与读线程回填缓存的顺序可能交错，导致旧值被写回。缓解手段是「延迟双删」（写完再延迟一段时间删除一次）或对同一 key 加分布式锁，两者都增加复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>写时更新（write-through）。</strong> 更新数据库同时更新缓存。一致性最好，但如果缓存是远程的（Redis），它引入了「数据库写成功而缓存写失败」的部分失败问题，需要重试或补偿。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>staleness 上界</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>部分失败风险</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TTL 过期</td>\n<td>TTL</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>读多写少、可容忍陈旧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写时失效</td>\n<td>无（理论上）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>缓存删除失败留脏值</td>\n<td>强一致读、写不频繁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写时更新</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>缓存写失败留脏值</td>\n<td>读极频繁、写可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多级 + 消息广播失效</td>\n<td>本地缓存 TTL</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>广播丢失留脏值</td>\n<td>高 QPS 且要求低延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多级缓存（本地 Caffeine + 远程 Redis）的收益是本地缓存命中时零网络往返，代价是<strong>失效广播</strong>：更新一个节点的本地缓存必须让所有节点的本地缓存失效，需要消息总线或 Redis pub/sub。广播消息丢失时，某些节点会长期持有旧值——这是一个不体现在指标里的静默故障，只有业务发现数据不对才会暴露。因此多级缓存必须配一个短的本地 TTL 作为兜底，即便广播机制工作正常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连接池容量的量化\">连接池容量的量化</h2><p>HikariCP 的默认值：<code>maximumPoolSize = 10</code>、<code>minimumIdle</code> 默认等于 <code>maximumPoolSize</code>（即固定大小池）、<code>connectionTimeout = 30000ms</code>、<code>idleTimeout = 600000ms</code>、<code>maxLifetime = 1800000ms</code>、<code>leakDetectionThreshold = 0</code>（关闭）（来源：HikariCP <code>HikariConfig</code> 源码常量, <a href=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/blob/dev/src/main/java/com/zaxxer/hikari/HikariConfig.java；配置项默认值说明见\">https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/blob/dev/src/main/java/com/zaxxer/hikari/HikariConfig.java；配置项默认值说明见</a> README, <a href=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP）。\">https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP）。</a></p>\n<p>池容量的经典起点公式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{conn} = (2 \\times C_{cores}) + E_{spindles}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nn</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{cores}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是物理 CPU 核数（非超线程数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{spindles}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是有效磁盘数（全内存数据集时为 0）。四核单盘的起点约是 9–10，与 HikariCP 的默认值一致（来源：HikariCP Wiki, About Pool Sizing — <code>connections = ((core_count * 2) + effective_spindle_count)</code>, <a href=\"https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/wiki/About-Pool-Sizing）。公式的适用前提是「数据库是本地或低延迟、且查询以\">https://github.com/brettwooldridge/HikariCP/wiki/About-Pool-Sizing）。公式的适用前提是「数据库是本地或低延迟、且查询以</a> CPU 与磁盘 I/O 为主」——这正是它的局限：<strong>云环境下数据库通常在网络另一端，往返延迟（RTT）是主要成本，此时公式低估了所需连接数</strong>。</p>\n<p>修正的思路是把公式换成基于延迟的计算。如果单个查询的实际服务时间（含 RTT）是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{svc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，目标吞吐是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，那么所需连接数是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{conn} \\geq Q \\times T_{svc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nn</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：单一数据库实例能服务 2000 QPS 的读查询，单个查询耗时 5ms，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.005</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 2000 \\times 0.005 = 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.005</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>。如果同一实例的写查询耗时 20ms、目标 200 QPS，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.02</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 200 \\times 0.02 = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>。这两个数相加再留 30% 余量，比按核数推导更贴近真实需求。</p>\n<p>判断「该加连接还是该修别处」，最有效的手段是看连接池指标而不是猜。HikariCP 通过 Micrometer 暴露 <code>hikaricp.connections.active</code>、<code>hikaricp.connections.idle</code>、<code>hikaricp.connections.pending</code>、<code>hikaricp.connections.acquire</code>（获取连接的耗时分布）。判据很清晰：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>pending</code> 长期大于 0 且 <code>acquire</code> 的 P99 上升 → 池容量不足，加连接可能有效。</li>\n<li><code>active</code> 远低于 <code>maximumPoolSize</code> 但请求仍慢 → 瓶颈不在池，加连接无效，应查查询计划或锁等待。</li>\n<li><code>active</code> 贴住上限且 <code>pending</code> 为 0 → 恰好饱和，但需先确认单个查询有没有优化空间，再决定扩容。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三个指标的采集配置见 <a href=\"../ops-observability/actuator-metrics-health\">Actuator 端点、Micrometer 指标与健康检查</a>，那里会说明如何让 Hikari 指标按池名打 tag 以及如何设置合理的直方图。</p>\n<p>一个常见误配是把 <code>maximumPoolSize</code> 设得远大于数据库的 <code>max_connections</code> 除以实例数。多实例部署时，总连接数 = 单实例池容量 × 实例数。如果 20 个 Pod 各配 50 个连接，就需要数据库支持 1000 个连接，多数托管数据库的默认上限（如 MySQL 默认 151，来源：MySQL 8.4 Reference Manual, Server System Variables — <code>max_connections</code> Default Value = 151, <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/server-system-variables.html）会直接被击穿，表现是部分实例间歇性获取连接失败而另一些正常——这种不均匀的故障形态很难从单个实例的指标上看出来。\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/server-system-variables.html）会直接被击穿，表现是部分实例间歇性获取连接失败而另一些正常——这种不均匀的故障形态很难从单个实例的指标上看出来。</a></p>\n<p><code>leakDetectionThreshold</code> 值得在预发环境打开（例如设为 20000ms）。它的作用是当连接被借出超过阈值仍未归还时打印堆栈，直接指出泄漏点。生产环境默认关闭是因为它需要对每次借出做计时检查，有微小开销；但在排查过一次连接泄漏之后，通常会把它保留在较低的值上，因为泄漏导致的池耗尽比检查开销严重得多。<code>minimumIdle</code> 建议保持默认（等于 <code>maximumPoolSize</code>），理由是固定大小池避免了「流量突增时需要临时建连」的延迟尖峰，而这个尖峰的时长通常正好落在最不能承受延迟的时刻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>缓存对数据库压力的真实贡献是「命中时查询不发生」，因此命中率是首要指标；低命中率的缓存只是额外成本。</li>\n<li>缓存与事务共享 AOP 机制，自调用同样失效；多租户场景 key 必须包含租户维度。</li>\n<li>失效策略选择的核心是 staleness 上界与部分失败风险的权衡；多级缓存必须配本地 TTL 兜底，因为失效广播可能丢。</li>\n<li>HikariCP 默认池大小为 10、固定大小、连接超时 30s；经典公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2C+E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 的前提是低延迟数据库，网络 RTT 大时应改用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\geq Q \\times T_{svc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>用 <code>hikaricp.connections.pending</code> 与 <code>acquire</code> 分布判断瓶颈是否在池；<code>active</code> 低但请求慢说明瓶颈在别处。</li>\n<li>多实例部署时总连接数是池容量与实例数之积，须先核对数据库 <code>max_connections</code> 上限。</li>\n<li>预发环境打开 <code>leakDetectionThreshold</code>，它能直接指出连接泄漏的来源，比事后从池耗尽反推便宜得多。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>池耗尽在线程层面的表现是「worker 线程全部阻塞在获取连接」，这与线程池容量不足的症状完全相同，识别方法见 <a href=\"mvc-thread-model\">Spring MVC 线程模型与异步请求</a>；如果结论是「瓶颈在池且数据库侧已无余量」，那么下一步通常不是继续扩池而是转向响应式或读副本，取舍见 <a href=\"../reactive-webflux/mvc-vs-webflux-decision\">MVC vs WebFlux 决策：别为了时髦付代价</a>。第三个连接池指标 <code>hikaricp.connections.acquire</code> 的采集与直方图配置见 <a href=\"../ops-observability/actuator-metrics-health\">Actuator 端点、Micrometer 指标与健康检查</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缓存抽象、连接池与数据访问性能","id":"缓存抽象-连接池与数据访问性能"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：缓存是乘数，连接池是上限","id":"核心概念-缓存是乘数-连接池是上限"},{"level":2,"text":"Spring Cache 抽象的位置","id":"spring-cache-抽象的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存的失效策略与一致性代价","id":"缓存的失效策略与一致性代价"},{"level":2,"text":"连接池容量的量化","id":"连接池容量的量化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"声明式事务、JPA N+1 与批量陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/spring-boot-production/web-data/transactions-jpa-pitfalls"},"next":{"title":"WebFlux/Netty 反应式模型与适用边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/spring-boot-production/reactive-webflux/webflux-netty-model"}}